-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
--  DUEL SPOOFER - TESTER / RECEIVER SIDE
--  Shows whatever the ADMIN spoofs, live, on a completely separate client.
--
--  HOW IT WORKS
--    The admin's client pushes {slot, brainrot, gen} to an HTTP relay.
--    This script long-polls that relay and re-renders the duel card locally:
--    name, $/s generation, and the real 3D model in a ViewportFrame.
--
--    This is required because Roblox executor scripts run CLIENT-SIDE, and
--    instances an executor creates are never replicated to other players.
--    Two different accounts therefore need an out-of-band channel (the relay).
--
--  SETUP
--    1. Run the relay:  node relay/server.js
--    2. Put its public URL in RELAY_URL below (same value on both scripts).
--    3. Set ROOM to the same string on both scripts.
--    4. Execute this on the TESTER account.
-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

